ed in v2 with inp…","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:12:31.348Z","title":"Write","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpd6v983_66aa3d34cf61":{"concepts":[],"confidence":0.3,"facts":[],"files":["/home/thien_long/travel_project/travel_project/accommodation_project/chat_api/location/strategies/base.py"],"id":"obs_mpd6v983_66aa3d34cf61","importance":5,"narrative":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nAbstract base class for location resolution strategies.\\nStrategy chain pattern — each strategy either resolves or yields to the next.\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nfrom abc import ABC, abstractmethod\\n\\nfrom ...nlu.dto import ResolvedLocation\\nfrom ..context import LocationContext\\n\\n\\nclass LocationStrategy(ABC):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    Pluggable location resolutio…","sessionId":"442e675a-a813-467d-a7e8-8f9fca92a42a","subtitle":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nAbstract base class for location resolution strategies.\\nStrategy chain pattern — each strategy eit…","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:12:44.760Z","title":"Write","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpd6vled_e3fd5de91225":{"concepts":[],"confidence":0.3,"facts":[],"files":["/home/thien_long/travel_project/travel_project/accommodation_project/chat_api/location/resolver.py"],"id":"obs_mpd6vled_e3fd5de91225","importance":5,"narrative":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nLocationResolver v2 — runs registered strategies sorted by order.\\n\\nUsage:\\n    resolver = LocationResolver.default()\\n    location = resolver.resolve(LocationContext(\\n        raw_text=\\\"gần Landmark 81\\\",\\n        input_kind=\\\"landmark_or_poi\\\",\\n        location_phrase=\\\"landmark 81\\\",\\n    ))\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nimport logging\\n\\nfrom ..nlu.dto …","sessionId":"442e675a-a813-467d-a7e8-8f9fca92a42a","subtitle":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nLocationResolver v2 — runs registered strategies sorted by order.\\n\\nUsage:\\n    resolver = Locatio…","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:13:00.538Z","title":"Write","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpd6vsxe_1faebf6c822d":{"concepts":[],"confidence":0.3,"facts":[],"files":["/home/thien_long/travel_project/travel_project/accommodation_project/chat_api/location/strategies/current_location.py"],"id":"obs_mpd6vsxe_1faebf6c822d","importance":5,"narrative":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nCurrentLocationStrategy — use browser GPS as the search anchor.\\n\\nHandles:\\n  - amenity_only + user_location   → near_user (user gave amenities, no explicit area)\\n  - unknown + user_location         → near_user (no clear intent, GPS is best guess)\\n\\nDoes NOT fire for landmark/address/hotel inputs — those strategies provide\\nmore specific location context and should take pri…","sessionId":"442e675a-a813-467d-a7e8-8f9fca92a42a","subtitle":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nCurrentLocationStrategy — use browser GPS as the search anchor.\\n\\nHandles:\\n  - amenity_only + use…","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:13:10.295Z","title":"Write","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpd6vzyl_c3c2371c8098":{"concepts":[],"confidence":0.3,"facts":[],"files":["/home/thien_long/travel_project/travel_project/accommodation_project/chat_api/location/strategies/selected_place.py"],"id":"obs_mpd6vzyl_c3c2371c8098","importance":5,"narrative":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nSelectedPlaceStrategy — user explicitly chose a place from a multiple_choice list.\\n\\nWhen the user resolves an ambiguous location by picking one of the offered options,\\nthe selected canonical name is stored in context.selected_place. This strategy\\nlooks it up in PlaceReference and returns a near_anchor result.\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nimport logging\\nf…","sessionId":"442e675a-a813-467d-a7e8-8f9fca92a42a","subtitle":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nSelectedPlaceStrategy — user explicitly chose a place from a multiple_choice list.\\n\\nWhen the user…","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:13:19.409Z","title":"Write","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpd6wagx_a8e81c6153b8":{"concepts":[],"confidence":0.3,"facts":[],"files":["/home/thien_long/travel_project/travel_project/accommodation_project/chat_api/location/strategies/hotel_name.py"],"id":"obs_mpd6wagx_a8e81c6153b8","importance":5,"narrative":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nHotelNameStrategy — resolve a named hotel via the Accommodation table.\\n\\nSearches the Accommodation model by name (case-insensitive contains) BEFORE\\nfalling through to geocoder. If a match is found, the hotel's stored coordinates\\n(if any) are used and mode is set to hotel_name so downstream code can show\\na direct property card instead of a list.\\n\\nIf no Accommodation matc…","sessionId":"442e675a-a813-467d-a7e8-8f9fca92a42a","subtitle":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nHotelNameStrategy — resolve a named hotel via the Accommodation table.\\n\\nSearches the Accommodatio…","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:13:33.030Z","title":"Write","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpd6wgle_36eeeda38a69":{"concepts":[],"confidence":0.3,"facts":[],"files":["/home/thien_long/travel_project/travel_project/accommodation_project/chat_api/location/strategies/direct_area.py"],"id":"obs_mpd6wgle_36eeeda38a69","importance":5,"narrative":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nDirectAreaStrategy — handles area-only queries.\\n\\nWhen the user specifies only a district/city with no landmark or coordinates,\\nthe recommendation engine filters by area name (no lat/lon needed). This strategy\\nreturns mode=AREA without attempting geocoding, keeping it fast and offline.\\n\\nExamples:\\n    \\\"Quận 3\\\"         → area=\\\"quan 3\\\", mode=AREA\\n    \\\"ở Phú Nhuận\\\"   …","sessionId":"442e675a-a813-467d-a7e8-8f9fca92a42a","subtitle":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nDirectAreaStrategy — handles area-only queries.\\n\\nWhen the user specifies only a district/city wit…","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:13:40.970Z","title":"Write","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpd6wr1s_b87a9e886c1f":{"concepts":[],"confidence":0.3,"facts":[],"files":["/home/thien_long/travel_project/travel_project/accommodation_project/chat_api/location/strategies/near_anchor.py"],"id":"obs_mpd6wr1s_b87a9e886c1f","importance":5,"narrative":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nNearAnchorFromPlaceReferenceStrategy — PlaceReference DB cache lookup.\\n\\nChecks the PlaceReference cache BEFORE calling any external geocoder.\\nOn cache hit: returns near_anchor with stored coordinates (fast, no API cost).\\nOn cache miss: returns None → FallbackGeocodeStrategy takes over.\\n\\nHandles:\\n  - landmark_or_poi   → \\\"gần Landmark 81\\\", \\\"gần Dinh Độc Lập\\\"\\n  - spec…","sessionId":"442e675a-a813-467d-a7e8-8f9fca92a42a","subtitle":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nNearAnchorFromPlaceReferenceStrategy — PlaceReference DB cache lookup.\\n\\nChecks the PlaceReference…","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:13:54.518Z","title":"Write","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpd6x4zc_fb0ae8525f94":{"concepts":[],"confidence":0.3,"facts":[],"files":["/home/thien_long/travel_project/travel_project/accommodation_project/chat_api/location/strategies/fallback_geocode.py"],"id":"obs_mpd6x4zc_fb0ae8525f94","importance":5,"narrative":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nFallbackGeocodeStrategy — external geocoder (Nominatim/OSM) as last-resort resolution.\\n\\nFires only when NearAnchorFromPlaceReferenceStrategy missed (cache miss).\\n\\nDesign:\\n  - Rate-limit guard is enforced inside nominatim_geocoder._wait_for_rate_limit().\\n  - Timeout guard: geocoder call runs in a thread with GEOCODE_TIMEOUT seconds.\\n    If it hangs, the future is cancell…","sessionId":"442e675a-a813-467d-a7e8-8f9fca92a42a","subtitle":"{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nFallbackGeocodeStrategy — external geocoder (Nominatim/OSM) as last-resort resolution.\\n\\nFires onl…","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:14:12.576Z","title":"Write","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpd6xky9_c2b1e5e67b07":{"concepts":[],"confidence":0.3,"facts":[],"files":["/home/thien_long/travel_project/travel_project/accommodation_project/chat_api/location/strategies/poi_centroid.py"],"id":"obs_mpd6xky9_c2b1e5e67b07","importance":5,"n